@startuml Feature3_Seq_1
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 3: Hiring Proposal - Sequence: Manager proposes, Director decides**

actor "Department Manager" as DM
actor Director
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nHiringProposalController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nHiringProposalService" as Svc
participant "<<service>>\nApplicationStateService" as StateSvc
participant "<<repository>>\nHiringProposalRepository" as Repo
participant "Database" as DB

DM -> UI: Read panel verdicts, click "Propose to hire"
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/applications/{id}/hiring-proposal
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: CreateAsync(companyId, userId, applicationId, dto)
activate Svc
note right of Svc: Application must be at INTERVIEW,\nhave >=1 submitted score (G2),\nand the caller must own the job

Svc -> Repo: InsertAsync(proposal PENDING)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: INSERT HiringProposal
activate DB
DB --> Repo: proposalId
deactivate DB
Repo --> Svc: return proposalId
deactivate Repo

Svc --> Ctrl: return HiringProposalDto (PENDING)
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> UI: return JSON
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> DM: "Sent to the director"
deactivate UI

== Director opens the queue ==

Director -> UI: Review proposal, set salary & start date, approve
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/hiring-proposals/{id}/decision
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: DecideAsync(companyId, userId, proposalId, dto)
activate Svc

Svc -> StateSvc: TransitionAsync(..., "OFFER", note)
activate StateSvc
note right of StateSvc: Guard G2 + "only the director\ndecides" check run here.\nTransition FIRST so a failure\nleaves the proposal PENDING.
StateSvc --> Svc: ok
deactivate StateSvc

Svc -> Repo: SaveAsync(status APPROVED + approved terms)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: UPDATE HiringProposal
activate DB
DB --> Repo: success
deactivate DB
Repo --> Svc: ok
deactivate Repo

Svc --> Ctrl: return HiringProposalDto (APPROVED)
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> UI: return JSON
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> Director: Application moved to the decision stage
deactivate UI

note over UI: HR then drafts the offer letter, pre-filled\nwith the salary and start date the director set.
@enduml
